Wait UI constructor calls `this.game.audio?.click` only on click; audio exists.

`setupScene` creates scene camera, renderer; create camera. World built in boot.

`initState`: money from save or 2500; completedFromSave; playMode 'story'; rp; player fields; arrays.

Careful `UI.updateDashboard` calls loadSave; not in constructor.

Player initial:
```
this.player = {position:new THREE.Vector3(-74,0,86), heading:Math.PI/2, health:100, armor:60, stamina:100, mag:12, reserve:48, weapon:'pistol', vy:0,onGround:true,dead:false}
